<title>LATVIA: Latvia 28-day T-bill yield drops at auction.</title>
<headline>Latvia 28-day T-bill yield drops at auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields of 28-day Latvian T-bills dipped at auction on Wednesday but 91-day paper saw a slight rise in yield, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p>MATURITY  AV YIELD  LAST WEEK  NO OF BANKS  ISSUE  BID SOLD</p>
<p> 28-day     4.46	4.50	   5	    0.75  1.95 0.75</p>
<p> 91-day     5.19	4.99	   5	    1.50  1.70 1.50</p>
<p> 182-day    5.33	5.43	   8	    2.0   3.82 2.0</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
